COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Modernization of our COA building, fire protection works, renovation of our profession.

asr-000146
00:41:32.170 --> 00:41:33.390
Senator Erwin Tulfo: When you say, ma'am, I'm sorry.

asr-000147
00:41:33.770 --> 00:41:38.030
Senator Erwin Tulfo: When you say modernization of your building, you're building here, your main office,

asr-000148
00:41:38.150 --> 00:41:39.610
Senator Erwin Tulfo: malapit sa Sandigan?

asr-000149
