COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Yes, the building one and two po.

asr-000150
00:41:41.550 --> 00:41:42.450
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Yung old one po.

asr-000151
00:41:42.450 --> 00:41:44.370
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Anong year ho ba 'yan naitayo?

asr-000152
00:41:44.470 --> 00:41:47.470
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: 1970.

asr-000153
00:41:47.770 --> 00:41:49.410
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Late sixties po, Your Honor.

asr-000154
00:41:49.650 --> 00:41:50.750
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Late sixties, Chairman.

asr-000155
00:41:51.050 --> 00:41:51.870
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Opo.

asr-000156
00:41:51.870 --> 00:41:52.230
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Opo.

asr-000157
00:41:53.230 --> 00:41:59.070
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With the indulgence of Senator Tulfo, meron lang akong nakita, just to clarify, last year, meron akong

asr-000158
00:41:59.070 --> 00:42:02.930
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: phase 2 doon sa new four-story building with a basement.

asr-000159
00:42:03.350 --> 00:42:08.390
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So tanong ko lang, what's the status, or meron pa tayong phase 3 for this?

asr-000160
00:42:08.430 --> 00:42:09.310
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito ba yung one billion?

asr-000161
00:42:10.130 --> 00:42:11.410
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Is it part of the phase 3?

asr-000162
00:42:11.410 --> 00:42:12.090
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: Hindi po, sir.

asr-000179
00:42:13.790 --> 00:42:18.510
