asr-002503
02:14:41.740 --> 02:14:44.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Can COA confirm whether this is accurate?

asr-002504
02:14:44.240 --> 02:14:44.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Is that 250?

asr-002505
02:14:44.980 --> 02:14:48.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Provided per day, proactively, or to the entire audit engagement?

asr-002506
02:14:49.980 --> 02:14:51.700
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Na-increase na po yan, Your Honor.

asr-002507
02:14:51.800 --> 02:14:53.960
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: But actually nga po, nasimulan na po namin yan.

asr-002508
02:14:54.040 --> 02:14:55.460
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: Yan po binabanggit ko sa inyo kanina,

asr-002509
