COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: audit

asr-002511
02:15:02.140 --> 02:15:04.160
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: ayun pong wala pong master plan.

asr-002512
02:15:04.880 --> 02:15:06.080
COA Chairperson Gamaliel A. Cordoba: So, actually po,

asr-002513
