02:15:39.740 --> 02:15:41.600
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: year, we already disbursed

asr-002531
02:15:41.600 --> 02:15:43.540
COA Assistant Commissioner Nilda B. Plaras: 10 million for the CPA

asr-002532
